# Hromada Strategy Collaboration Mapping

**Product:** candidate МСС agreements (pair · theme · one of 5 Law 1508-VII forms).
Strategy NLP, geo, complementary, explicit-ask, network are **discovery signals**,
not IMC types. Spin-out from w3i-network (2026-07-23); NocoDB `Hromadas` still shared.

